      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is a great find! I have one minor request for how drawSpecial handles notifying the bitmap that pixels are changed. It turns out every other draw all in SkBitmapDevice goes through \"accessPixels()\", which automatically notifies the bitmap has changed. Fundamentally, where I commented, achieves the same fix that you made, so should still resolve the gen ID issue causing problems in chromium.",
